{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-1.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/anything_but.png?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>A Simple Ball Game</strong>, lead our spherical friend, the ball, through tricky pathways and  moving obstacles to finally reach the goal. Each level is a sandbox full of possibilities, many with unconventional or hidden shortcuts to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is all about creativity, so it is up to you to decide how to approach each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-4.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/learn_what.png?t=1745023964\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 70 challenging stages that will push your creativity and platforming skills to the limit. From narrow pathways and downward spirals, to sprawling puzzle-box contraptions, no two stages are quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Challenge Mode, take on the gauntlet of stages back to back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rogue Mode, even a simple mistake could cost you the run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Practice Mode, learn each level inside out and hone your ball rolling prowess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the artifacts to unlock a set of extra stages that will really test your ball rolling abilities. There's one hidden somewhere on each level, so keep a look out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look your spherical best with over 30 visual  modifications for your ball. Try out different combinations and colors to create your own uniquely  smooth style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete hidden achievements and unlock rare visual  modifications for your ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With three styles of play: controller, mouse, and keyboard, approach the game any way you like. For maximum precision, a controller is highly recommended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-5.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281330?t=1745023964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745023964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/801d411d31a770a33d570233dff4271bb714d038/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745023964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/801d411d31a770a33d570233dff4271bb714d038/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745023964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-1.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/anything_but.png?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>A Simple Ball Game</strong>, lead our spherical friend, the ball, through tricky pathways and  moving obstacles to finally reach the goal. Each level is a sandbox full of possibilities, many with unconventional or hidden shortcuts to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is all about creativity, so it is up to you to decide how to approach each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-4.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/learn_what.png?t=1745023964\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 70 challenging stages that will push your creativity and platforming skills to the limit. From narrow pathways and downward spirals, to sprawling puzzle-box contraptions, no two stages are quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Challenge Mode, take on the gauntlet of stages back to back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rogue Mode, even a simple mistake could cost you the run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Practice Mode, learn each level inside out and hone your ball rolling prowess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the artifacts to unlock a set of extra stages that will really test your ball rolling abilities. There's one hidden somewhere on each level, so keep a look out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look your spherical best with over 30 visual  modifications for your ball. Try out different combinations and colors to create your own uniquely  smooth style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete hidden achievements and unlock rare visual  modifications for your ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With three styles of play: controller, mouse, and keyboard, approach the game any way you like. For maximum precision, a controller is highly recommended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/extras/SteamGIF-5.gif?t=1745023964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Pajama Town"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281330/header.jpg?t=1745023964","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Pajama Town","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257086115,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086115/movie480.mp4?t=1735879198","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086115/movie_max.mp4?t=1735879198"},"name":"Gameplay - A Simple Ball Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086115/fa0695c05831e81438ac3613c5efa7a672788f5e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1735879198","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086115/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1735879198","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086115/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1735879198"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257093228,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093228/movie480.mp4?t=1738241969","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093228/movie_max.mp4?t=173